  "question": "A body weighs $48$ N on the surface of the earth. The gravitational force experienced by the body due to the earth at a height equal to one-third the radius of the earth from its surface is :",
  "diagram": "",
  "diagram_alt": "",
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "$16$ N",
      "image": ""
    },
    {
      "text": "$27$ N",
      "image": ""
    },
    {
      "text": "$32$ N",
      "image": ""
    },
    {
      "text": "$36$ N",
      "image": ""
    }
  ],
  "answer": "B",
  "numerical_answer": "",
  "tolerance": "",
  "solution": "$$F = F_0\\left(\\frac{R}{R + h}\\right)^2 = 48\\left(\\frac{R}{4R/3}\\right)^2 = 48 \\times \\frac{9}{16} = 27\\ \\text{N}$$",
